  <name>VPN Gate Client</name>
  <summary>GTK4 client for VPN Gate public VPN relay servers</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      VPN Gate Client is a Linux desktop application that connects to VPN Gate
      public VPN relay servers. It fetches the server list from the VPN Gate
      project API, displays real-time connection statistics, and manages VPN
      connections through NetworkManager.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Fetch and display public VPN relay servers worldwide</li>
      <li>Connect to OpenVPN servers via NetworkManager</li>
      <li>Real-time connection statistics</li>
      <li>System tray integration with show/hide/quit</li>
      <li>Configurable connection preferences</li>
    </ul>
  </description>

  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.apicalshark.vpngategtk.desktop</launchable>

  <url type="homepage">https://github.com/apicalshark/vpngate-gtk</url>
